Forward 1 m  X+
rostopic pub /move_base_simple/goal geometry_msgs/PoseStamped "{header: {stamp: now, frame_id: 'base_link'}, pose: {position: {x: 1.0, y: 0.0, z: 0.0},orientation: {x: 0.0, y: 0.0, z: 0.0, w: 1.0}}}" -1

Backward 1 m  X-
rostopic pub /move_base_simple/goal geometry_msgs/PoseStamped "{header: {stamp: now, frame_id: 'base_link'}, pose: {position: {x: -1.0, y: 0.0, z: 0.0}, orientation: {x: 0.0, y: 0.0, z: 0.0, w: 1.0}}}" -1

Y+
rostopic pub /move_base_simple/goal geometry_msgs/PoseStamped "{header: {stamp: now, frame_id: 'base_link'}, pose: {position: {x: 0.0, y: 1.0, z: 0.0}, orientation: {x: 0.0, y: 0.0, z: 0.0, w: 1.0}}}" -1
Y-
rostopic pub /move_base_simple/goal geometry_msgs/PoseStamped "{header: {stamp: now, frame_id: 'base_link'}, pose: {position: {x: 0.0, y: -1.0, z: 0.0}, orientation: {x: 0.0, y: 0.0, z: 0.0, w: 1.0}}}" -1

180 
rostopic pub /move_base_simple/goal geometry_msgs/PoseStamped "{header: {stamp: now, frame_id: 'base_link'}, pose: {position: {x: 0.0, y: 0.0, z: 0.0}, orientation: {x: 0.0, y: 0.0, z: 1.0, w: 0.0}}}" -1
90 
rostopic pub /move_base_simple/goal geometry_msgs/PoseStamped "{header: {stamp: now, frame_id: 'base_link'}, pose: {position: {x: 0.0, y: 0.0, z: 0.0}, orientation: {x: 0.0, y: 0.0, z: 0.707, w: 0.707}}}" -1
-90
rostopic pub /move_base_simple/goal geometry_msgs/PoseStamped "{header: {stamp: now, frame_id: 'base_link'}, pose: {position: {x: 0.0, y: 0.0, z: 0.0}, orientation: {x: 0.0, y: 0.0, z: -0.707, w: 0.707}}}" -1

clear
rosservice call /move_base/clear_costmaps


